  "stageId": "a001_ex01",
  "title": "True Grit",
  "storyCode": "GT-EX-1",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_ex01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fde7abde12142182d2e7c6c887af60af3f613d79171a31c578e1f632958d3a04",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "...We should stuff him into a sack...\n...and hang him on the mast at dawn...\n...We should slit his throat...\n...and offer him to the ocean as a tribute to the raging hurricane..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "Ugh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "...that same dream again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "Who is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "...Oh, it's just you. Hm, I can't even seem to remember your name."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "That doesn't matter. Just treat me like any normal Rhodes Island operator."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "You look like you're in pain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "It's just another nightmare."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "Dark fragments swirling in my consciousness, hidden beneath the shadows of that broken church..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "When I approach them, they turn into shackles and drag me down into the deep sea."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "But soon, there will be a way to escape your torment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "Heh, is that so? That'd be great. But why should I trust you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "Heh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "Your aura... I'm quite familiar with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "No, it's your smell. It's an intense, pungent smell... the smell of blood... 'their' smell. The smell of the deep sea."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "It's a familiar and abhorrent smell."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Is that so?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "Can you tell me your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Skadi."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "Interesting. So, why did you decide to show up here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "You're not supposed to be here without permission from Kal'tsit, unless you're not afraid of me ripping you to pieces."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "I am afraid. Just like everyone else. However, I'm used to fear."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "It's time to go. By the time I come back, things may have already moved forward. However, you can forget all about me, just like before."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "char_143_ghost",
      "operatorId": "char_143_ghost",
      "portraitKey": "char_143_ghost",
      "text": "Where are you going?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "To where the secret is buried."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "A place far, far away from you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
